2026-11-11 10:09:17,889 INFO mulder.orchestrator.display: [dashboard] ### CRITICAL COUNTER-EVIDENCE DISCOVERED:
2026-11-11 10:09:17,890 INFO mulder.orchestrator.display: [dashboard] 1. **NO PACKET CAPTURE FILES**: Despite Ethereal being installed and executed (prefetch 2004-08-27 15:34:54), NO .pcap, .cap, or .dmp capture files exist on the system. This is the most significant finding - packet capture tools without captured data suggest troubleshooting, not active surveillance.
