2026-11-11 10:09:17,893 INFO mulder.orchestrator.display: [dashboard] 3. **SERIOUS TOOLS NOT EXECUTED**: My Documents contains serious network reconnaissance tools (NMAP, SUPERSCAN, DSNIFF, SPADE, OGRE) organized in FOOTPRINTING/ENUMERATION/EXPLOITATION directories. None show prefetch execution evidence.
2026-11-11 10:09:17,893 INFO mulder.orchestrator.display: [dashboard] 4. **IRC LOGS LACK HACKING CONTENT**: Channel names are suggestive (#Elite.Hackers, #evilfork, #iso-warez) but keyword searches in actual log content found no discussions of hacking techniques, exploits, or attack planning - only general chat topics (sports/news).
2026-11-11 10:09:17,894 INFO mulder.orchestrator.display: [dashboard] 5. **CRITICAL 7-DAY TIMELINE GAP**: IRC activity occurred 2004-08-20, but tool execution didn't occur until 2004-08-27. This 7-day gap breaks coherence of a supposed coordinated attack sequence.
2026-11-11 10:09:17,895 INFO mulder.orchestrator.display: [dashboard] 6. **NO ATTACK ARTIFACTS**: No exfiltration evidence, no network scanning outputs, no attack planning files discovered.
